), a notification day is:* >> >>> *(a) the 4 days, in each year, specified in the regulations; or* >>> >>> *(b) if no days are specified in the regulations for the purposes of paragraph (a)—each 1 January, 1 April, 1 July and 1 October.* >> >> *(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), the categories of staff member are the following:* >> >>> *(a) registered nurses;* >>> >>> *(b) enrolled nurses;* >>> >>> *(c) personal care attendants;* >>> >>> *(d) allied health staff;* >>> >>> *(e) other staff members involved in the de","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-6154","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2019-12-05/3"}
